# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RPS Arena — .gitignore
#
# This is a zero-build, single-file app. The ONLY source that ships
# is index.html plus the four Markdown docs. Everything ignored here
# is scratch produced by optional verification tooling or the OS —
# none of it is required to run the app.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Verification scratch (see prompt.md §4 / README §13) ---
app.js               # the <script> block extracted for `node --check`
/verify/             # headless-harness working directory
/screenshots/        # rendered visual-review captures
*.tmp

# --- Optional Node tooling (the app itself needs none of this) ---
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log

# --- Build artifacts (there is no build; guard against accidental ones) ---
dist/
build/

# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- Editors / IDEs ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# --- OS cruft ---
# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
# Linux
.directory
.Trash-*
